# Application entry points configure project metadata; the UI model owns it.
import ../../../state.dl

to [configure the website source editor] {C string:label} [named] {string:filename} [prefixed by] {string:prefix} [using] {a pointer to JSON value:profiles} [in] {a pointer to website state:state}:
    set editor to the UI source editor labeled label in (state's language)
    set document to editor's document's project's entry
    configure UI source document document named filename at ("file:///workspace/" + filename) prefixed by prefix using profiles with files (document's project's files)

to [configure the website shader source named] {string:filename} [in] {a pointer to website state:state}:
    set profiles to UI fragment analysis
    if state's shader editor's description's geometry's kind != 0:
        free profiles
        set profiles to UI vertex and fragment analysis
    configure the website source editor "Shader source" named filename prefixed by "" using profiles in state

to get the website editor uses shaders in {a pointer to website state:state}:
    return (the value of "IDE modes" in (state's view's instance)) = 1

to get the website source filename in {a pointer to website state:state}:
    return (the website source editor in state)'s document's project's entry's filename

to get the website source editor in {a pointer to website state:state}:
    set node to the active UI editor within (the control labeled "IDE modes" in (state's view's instance)) in (state's view's instance)
    return the UI source editor labeled (node's text) in (state's language)

to get the website source text in {a pointer to website state:state}:
    return the UI main source of (the website source editor in state) in (state's language) at (state's view's seconds) seconds

to [load website source] {C string:label} [from] {string:source} [in] {a pointer to website state:state}:
    set editor to the UI source editor labeled label in (state's language)
    load UI main source of editor in (state's view) from source at (state's view's seconds) seconds
